    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the high-stakes world of football management with <i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2025</i>! Step into the shoes of a general manager and take command of your favorite franchise like never before. With a fully customizable game world, you\u2019ll shape every aspect of your team\u2019s journey\u2014from drafting rising stars and negotiating trades to signing key free agents and building a legacy to rival the greats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for an even deeper experience? Craft complex gameday strategies, design your own plays and playbooks, and, with our reimagined game display, call each play as you guide your team from the sidelines to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2025</i> delivers the ultimate in realism and immersion for franchise mode enthusiasts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the high-stakes world of football management with <i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2025</i>! Step into the shoes of a general manager and take command of your favorite franchise like never before. With a fully customizable game world, you\u2019ll shape every aspect of your team\u2019s journey\u2014from drafting rising stars and negotiating trades to signing key free agents and building a legacy to rival the greats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for an even deeper experience? Craft complex gameday strategies, design your own plays and playbooks, and, with our reimagined game display, call each play as you guide your team from the sidelines to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2025</i> delivers the ultimate in realism and immersion for franchise mode enthusiasts.</p>",
    "short_description": "Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2025 puts you in the role of general manager of your favorite football team. Every decision can be made by you from drafting, trading, signing free agents right down to creating and calling your own plays to lead your team to championship glory and becoming a dynasty.",
